        "name": "preview_ship_to_yard_transfer",
        "description": "Read-only plan for a reversible ship-to-yard kinematic DEMO: select the TOP returned deck slot in a ship bay and side row (port=left facing bow; row_from_side=1 is the outermost port/starboard row, not rowNo01), then place on top of a rendered yard stack. Resolves 40ft support covering odd bays, checks stack height and neighbors, chooses a reachable STS and a parked truck, returns plan_id. These vessel structure slots are NOT verified actual cargo. Use this before starting the complete STS/truck/RTG demonstration; do not chain the old fixed-box demos.",
